      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SISTINE TUNNEL (4) turned in a strong run two starts ago at Mornington then failed to back it up over 1247m at Geelong last time, beaten 4.5 lengths into fifth. Coming back in trip suits so she is right in this. SMART LITTLE MISS (2) was in the money two starts back at this track but couldn't back it up last time when eighth, beaten 4 lengths, at Pakenham Synthetic over 1200m. Finds the right race this time and can find winning form. DIVINE VICKY (1) turned in a good performance last time over 1000m at Cranbourne, finishing 2 lengths from the winner in sixth. The extra journey should play into her hands and she looks one of the better chances. SMOKE SCREEN (6) was out of the money when resuming from a spell last start over 1000m at Mildura, beaten 4.5 lengths. Fitter so expect a better run this time. IMMORTAL JUSTICE (7) has placed at both first-up runs to date and has been trialling up this time in line another forward showing is on the cards.",
